---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer>
  <div class="container footer-grid">
    <div>
      <strong>原力战略</strong>
      <p>把你的不可复制，变成会复利的事业系统。</p>
    </div>
    <p class="meta">公开安全投影 · 正典真源位于 yuanli-strategy-soul<br />© {year} Yuanli Strategy</p>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
  footer { margin-top: 80px; padding: 44px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .footer-grid { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 32px; align-items: flex-end; }
  p { margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .footer-grid { display: block; } }
</style>
